.bsky.social","o":"PHLY Sports","t":"I won't go so far as to say that Dan Vladar is \"keeping the Flyers in it\" because Utah hasn't had a ton of Grade-A opportunities. Lot from distance. But they are getting a lot of shots, and Vladar has been very sharp so far on all of them.","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/charlieoconn.bsky.social/post/3mzbr3iygz22r"}],"team":"PHI","threads":[],"videos":[]}